            <field name="description">Specimen SMP/2026/0155 failed at 28 days: 25.9 MPa against C25/30 target of 25.0 MPa. However, given compliance breaches on the parent load, the result is considered unsatisfactory and warrants full CAPA review.</field>
            <field name="root_cause">Linked to NCR/2026/0014 — water addition and drum over-revolution on parent load.</field>
            <field name="immediate_action">Core samples drilled from placed concrete for independent verification of in-situ strength.</field>
            <field name="responsible_id" ref="base.user_admin"/>
            <field name="target_close_date">2026-10-05</field>
